Z||000007||fiero56||12-11-2000||04:04 PM||||The headlight motors are finished. I seem to remmeber when I removed the headlight housings, that I messed up some home-made wiring job, and don't feel like putting it back together anytime soon. So for now, both headlights are in the "up" position, "on" or "off".<P>The water-pump still isn't finished on the Formula. I could have finished long ago, but for some reason I have had no desire to work on that car for the last month or so. Could be I'm having too much fun blasting around town in the SE to care about the Formula. I really like my '86. Ride is smooth, steering is light, throttle is light, transmission is smooth, shifter cables don't bind, the seats are softer, no sunroof to squeak or rattle, the engine doesn't constantly try to overheat... I could go on, but you get the idea.<p>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 12-11-2000).]||||reg||1
